      "description": {
        "fun": "A shy little witch-in-training that feels everyone's emotions through the hat-like tail on its head. Strong feelings wear it out, so it runs from them as fast as it can and prefers places where nobody lives. It will only warm to someone with a calm disposition. Its line is all female, a mirror of the all-male Impidimp line beside it in the Pokédex.",
        "guide": "A small Psychic-type Pokémon that senses the emotions of others through the protrusion on its head, and avoids strong emotions and crowded places. Hatenna's line is female-only and resembles witches. It evolves into Hattrem and then Hatterene.",
