      "description": {
        "fun": "To Hattrem, strong emotions feel like deafening noise, even happy ones. So when someone nearby is feeling too much, it silences them by pummelling them with its braids, and one blow could knock out a professional boxer. Its hair-hat may play on the folk belief that a witch's power lives in her hair.",
