      "description": {
        "fun": "Known as the Forest Witch, Hatterene guards silent woods: if a forest shows no sign of living creatures, you may have wandered into its territory. It sends out psychic power strong enough to give intruders headaches, and anyone too loud risks the claws on its long hair. That floor-length hair may also nod to Rapunzel.",
        "guide": "The final evolution of Hatenna, a Psychic and Fairy Pokémon known as the Forest Witch. Hatterene lives alone in quiet forests and drives away intruders with headache-inducing psychic power. It has a Gigantamax form.",
        "tagline": "The Forest Witch, and she wants silence",
